  "prefLabel": "Nur 303.01 Applicant Responsibility for Examination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 303.01 Applicant Responsibility for Examination. Each applicant for licensure shall:\n\n(a) Contact the appropriate examining entity;\n\n(b) Submit all required application materials, including any required fees, to the OPLC;\n\n(c) Arrange to sit for all portions of the required examination with the appropriate examination entity; and\n\n(d) Pass all portions of the required examination.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Nur 100) #5887, eff 8-26-94; ss by #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #8664, INTERIM, eff 6-24-06, EXPIRED: 12-21-06\n\nNew. #8873, eff 4-24-07; ss by #10298, eff 3-22-13, EXPIRED: 3-22-23\n\nNew. #13886, eff 4-22-24; ss by #14295, eff 8-25-25, EXPIRES: 8-25-35",
